      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts two caricatured Jewish men in stereotypical attire, with text claiming that 'white people worldwide need to know that south africa is a template for europe, america, australia, canada' and 'we jews control all white countries media & education'. This content directly invokes antisemitic tropes, including the false and harmful claim of Jewish global control over media and education, which is a well-documented antisemitic conspiracy theory. The visual caricatures reinforce negative stereotypes. The overall intent is to spread antisemitic misinformation and promote hatred against Jewish people by attributing global influence and control to them, which constitutes a hateful message targeting a specific protected group based on religion.",
