      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material stating 'we jews control all white countries media & education', which is a direct assertion of antisemitic conspiracy theory. The user is implicitly positioned as someone who is meant to 'know' or 'understand' this claim, as suggested by the top text 'white people worldwide need to know...'. This creates a projection where the user is expected to internalize or accept the false premise that Jewish people control global media and education, thereby aligning with the meme's hateful intent.",
